tdialogue\">Later that night at the Bistro</span>", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le16ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Rachel, may I have a word?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>:  What? I'm ready to go. It's late.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We need to talk about your job performance lately.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: I've been working as hard as anyone here. Who works as hard as me?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: This is not a conversation about your work rate, it's about your attitude.\nYour disposition lately has been surly at best.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: My attitude is fine ...\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Your demeanor towards customers and co-workers has become problematic.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: Well, maybe my attitude would change if I didn't have to work in such chaos. Michael earns more than me and he is as disorganized as he is rude.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You are speaking as if you're the manager. Listen! Michael is a bartender and he has his responsibilities.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le16ob03re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "44000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: That's besides the point. I do the work as it should be done, I have worked here longer than anyone and I don't get treated with respect.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You may have worked here a long time and you may have done a good job in the past, but I have recently seen you mistreat customers and tonight I witnessed you disparage and belittle colleagues in front of customers. Then, I noticed someone left the till open behind the bar.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: That was not me! That was Jose!\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Jose might have opened the till, the other bartenders might have done it ... I don't know! But I watched you walk right by it twice and not close it.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le16ob03re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "81700", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: I know what is going on here. I am not as silly as you think I am! This is a conspiracy against me.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, Rachel.  I'm afraid I'm going to have to ...\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa Text</span>: \u201cNothing is permanent in this wicked world, not even our troubles.\u201d-Charlie Chaplin.  Love Sally.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Rachel. It's later than I thought. Go home get some sleep. We'll talk about this later.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: But ...\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Rachel. Good night.", "id": 4, "image": "engenn11le16ob03re2img05.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le16ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le16ob03re2img01.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}